Source: iris-vpu
Section: non-free/kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Video Driver Maintainers <video-driver.maintainers@qti.qualcomm.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-sequence-dkms, cpio
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/video-driver

Package: iris-vpu-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: DKMS package for Qualcomm iris_vpu video driver
 This package provides the DKMS source for the iris_vpu kernel module,
 the Qualcomm MSM VIDC out-of-tree video driver for Qualcomm platforms.
 .
 The driver supports multiple platforms and automatically detects the
 platform from device tree compatible string to enable appropriate
 configuration macros.
 .
 Supported platforms: hamoa (X1E80100), lemans (SA8775P).